# Kubernetes Networking 
Kubernetes Networking allows communication between Pods, Services, and external users inside a Kubernetes cluster.

> Goal of Kubernetes Networking
Pod-to-Pod Communication
Pod-to-Service Communication
External-to-Service Communication
Load Balancing
>Pod-to-Pod Communication
Har Pod ko unique IP address milta hai.
Pod-A (10.1.1.2)
       ↓
Pod-B (10.1.1.3)
Pod-A directly Pod-B se baat kar sakta hai bina NAT ke.

2. Services
Service Kubernetes ka ek resource hai jo Pods ko expose karta hai aur unke liye ek stable IP aur DNS name provide karta hai.

Pod restart hone par uska IP change ho sakta hai, lekin Service ka IP stable rehta hai.
> Example
Pods
 ↓
Service
 ↓
Users
> Benefits
Stable Endpoint
Load Balancing
Service Discovery
Easy Communication
> Interview Answer (English)
A Kubernetes Service provides a stable network endpoint and enables communication with Pods, even if Pod IP addresses change.

3. ClusterIP
ClusterIP Kubernetes ka default Service type hai jo application ko sirf cluster ke andar expose karta hai.
External users ise access nahi kar sakte.

Example
Pod-A
  ↓
ClusterIP Service
  ↓
Pod-B
Use Cases
Backend APIs
Database Services
Internal Microservices
Interview Answer (English)

ClusterIP is the default Kubernetes Service type that exposes an application internally within the cluster using a virtual IP address.

4. NodePort
Definition (Hindi)

NodePort Service application ko Worker Node ke port par expose karti hai.

External users Node IP aur Port ke through application access kar sakte hain.

Example
User
 ↓
192.168.1.10:30080
 ↓
NodePort Service
 ↓
Pods
Port Range
30000 - 32767
Use Cases
Testing
Development Environment
Interview Answer (English)

NodePort exposes a Kubernetes Service on a static port of each worker node, allowing external access using NodeIP and Port.

5. LoadBalancer
LoadBalancer Service cloud provider ke Load Balancer ko create karti hai aur application ko internet par expose karti hai.
Traffic automatically multiple Pods me distribute hota hai.
> Example
Internet
   ↓
Load Balancer
   ↓
Service
   ↓
Pods
> Benefits
External Access
High Availability
Load Distribution
> Interview Answer (English)
LoadBalancer is a Service type that exposes an application externally by creating a cloud provider load balancer and distributing traffic across Pods.

6. Service Discovery
Service Discovery Kubernetes ka mechanism hai jo Services ko automatically discover karne ki facility deta hai.
Pods IP ya Port yaad rakhe bina Service Name se connect kar sakte hain.
> Example
frontend-service
       ↓
backend-service
Benefits
Easy Communication
No Hardcoded IPs
Dynamic Environment Support
> Interview Answer (English)
Service Discovery allows Kubernetes services to communicate using service names instead of IP addresses, making communication dynamic and reliable.

7. Kubernetes DNS
Kubernetes DNS internal DNS system hai jo Services aur Pods ke naam ko IP address me convert karta hai.
Har Service ka automatic DNS name generate hota hai.
> Example
backend-service.default.svc.cluster.local
DNS is naam ko Service IP me resolve karta hai.
> Benefits
Automatic Name Resolution
Easy Service Communication
No Need to Remember IPs
>Interview Answer (English)
Kubernetes DNS provides internal name resolution by mapping service names to IP addresses, enabling easy communication between applications.

8. Ingress
Ingress Kubernetes resource hai jo HTTP aur HTTPS traffic ko manage karta hai aur requests ko different Services tak route karta hai.

> Example
app.company.com
        ↓
      Ingress
        ↓
     Service
        ↓
       Pods
> Features
Path-based Routing
Host-based Routing
SSL/TLS Support
Single Entry Point
> Use Cases
Multiple Websites
Production Applications
> Interview Answer (English)
Ingress is a Kubernetes resource that manages external HTTP and HTTPS traffic and routes requests to appropriate services.

9. Ingress Controller
Ingress Controller ek application hai jo Ingress rules ko implement karta hai.
Ingress sirf configuration provide karta hai, actual routing Ingress Controller karta hai.
> Popular Ingress Controllers
NGINX Ingress Controller
Traefik
HAProxy
AWS Load Balancer Controller
> Example
Internet
   ↓
Ingress Controller
   ↓
Ingress Rules
   ↓
Services
   ↓
Pods
> Why Needed?
Ingress resource khud traffic route nahi karta.
Ingress Controller hi rules ko execute karta hai.

> Interview Answer (English)
An Ingress Controller is a component that implements Ingress rules and manages external HTTP/HTTPS traffic routing to Kubernetes services.